  "title": "Rwanda: TotalEnergies Joins Forces with DelAgua to Bring Clean Cooking into 200,000 Households",
  "summary": "Paris, 13 November 2025 – TotalEnergies has partnered with DelAgua to distribute improved cookstoves to hundreds of thousands of Rwandans. The initiative supports Rwanda’s ambition to bring clean cooking to everyone by 2030 and reflects TotalEnergies’ ambition to supply energy that is more affordable, more available, more sustainable and accessible to as many people as possible. […]",
